### EFAR API - Jasper's Feature Area (AR Billing, Pricing Engine & Invoice Sync)
### REST Client extension for VS Code - open this file and click "Send Request" above each ###
###
### NOTE: This API has no /api/auth/login endpoint - auth uses pre-signed dev JWTs
### (see api-documentation.md Section 10 "Dev Auth Reference"). The @arToken variable
### below stands in for "token from login" and is reused by every request that follows.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api

# Pre-signed dev tokens (HS256, shared dev secret, expire 2027-06-22)
@arToken = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJzdWIiOjEsIm5hbWUiOiJTYXJhaCBUYW4iLCJlbWFpbCI6InNhcmFoQGVmYXIuc2ciLCJyb2xlIjoiYXJfc3BlY2lhbGlzdCIsImlhdCI6MTc4MjExNDQyNSwiZXhwIjoxODEzNjUwNDI1fQ.ESzmUh8-f6nRvC0MH0c3t13hSEfeapsAYD4ResqL4pM
